# Ankush Shetty — Developer Portfolio

A modern, responsive personal developer portfolio built using **HTML, CSS, and JavaScript**.

The website presents my skills, projects, education, coding journey, and contact information through a futuristic interface with smooth animations, glassmorphism cards, neon gradients, and interactive elements.

## 🚀 Live Portfolio

Add your deployed website link here:

`https://your-portfolio-link.com`

## 📌 About the Project

This portfolio was created as part of a **Web Fundamentals assignment** to demonstrate practical knowledge of:

* HTML structure
* CSS styling and responsive layouts
* JavaScript interactions
* Flexbox and CSS Grid
* Animations and transitions
* Responsive web design
* Git and GitHub

The goal was to create a professional developer portfolio that is both visually engaging and easy to navigate.

## ✨ Features

* Modern futuristic UI
* Fully responsive design
* Mobile-friendly navigation
* Dark / Light mode
* Animated background particles
* Glassmorphism cards
* Neon gradient effects
* Smooth scrolling
* Scroll reveal animations
* Interactive project cards
* 3D card tilt effects
* Animated statistics
* Skill progress indicators
* Dynamic active navigation
* Interactive contact form
* Responsive education timeline
* GitHub and LinkedIn links
* Resume download button
* Accessibility-friendly reduced-motion support

